{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misosuggestionchip"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(_:tableName:bundle:action:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(image:_:tableName:bundle:action:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(image:accessibilityLabel:action:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(image:accessibilityLabel:tableName:bundle:action:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(image:text:action:)","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/init(text:action:)"],"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/body"],"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOSuggestionChip\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MI